; coredll-doc.def -- coredll.dll export surface for Windows CE.
;
; Copyright (c) 2026 Akari API contributors
; SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
;
; Evidence policy: docs/clean-room.md v3 (2026-09-18) as narrowed by the
; owner 2026-09-19: the minimum Windows CE API surface needed to build
; CE applications (the "-dev package" of the CE SDK).  OAK / BSP /
; driver / kernel exports are OUT of scope (no include/oak, no
; CEDDK/NK/FSD surface).  Every entry below is grounded in the official
; Microsoft CE documentation preserved in kagurasumusun/wince-docs-corpus
;
; 1. DOC-CORE      -- Requirements row names Coredll.lib (incl. dual rows
;                   "Coredll.lib, Nk.lib / Nkstub.lib / OEMMain.lib" and the
;                   Coredll.lib + component-library rows).
; 2. DOC-COMPONENT -- Requirements row names the link library of a documented
;                   coredll/gwes component (Module pages ms923451 / aa448387 /
;                   ee482607: e.g. Coreimm.lib, Caret.lib, Msgque.lib).
;                   These components are statically linked into coredll.dll,
;                   so their exports are part of the coredll import surface.
;                   Grouped below by documented component library.
; 3. DOC-NOLIB     -- documented in the corpus (function title page) without
;                   a Link Library row (core GWES window APIs), cross-checked
;                   against the CeGCC-lineage w32api coredll.def (clean-room.md
;                   s.4: reference for value/structure confirmation only).
;
; Restructure 2026-09-19 (ledger: docs/def-restructure-2026-09-19.tsv):
;   - removed 51 OAK/driver exports (CEDDK.lib 36 incl. READ_/WRITE_ port
;     macros + Hal*/Mm*, Fsdmgr.lib 6, Nk.lib-only 6, Nkstub.lib-only 1,
;     Device.lib 2)
;   - moved 9 CryptMsg*/CryptVerifyCertificateSignature to crypt32-doc.def
;   - moved 2 CeGet*DeviceId to ceutil-doc.def
;   - removed 2 LASS functions documented "no link library is exposed"
;   - removed 22 Ce*Database*/Ce*DBVol* duplicated in rapi-doc.def
;     (they stay HERE: documented "Coredll.lib, Rapi.lib")
;   - added 222 DOC-NOLIB exports (was dropped 2026-09-18 as
;     "Requirements name ?"; ledger rows: add + page ids + R1 cross-check)
; CRT functions (malloc/qsort/...) are documented coredll components
; (Ccrtrtti.lib/Fullcrt.lib/Lmem.lib, Module pages) and stay.
;
; Ordinals are not published; entries are name-only.
